      "notes": "Acronyms spelled out, product names keep natural pronunciation"
    },
    {
      "original": "Edge-TTS is free and supports multiple Taiwan voices like HsiaoChenNeural.",
      "tts_version": "Edge T T S 是免費的，支持包括 HsiaoChenNeural 在內的多個台灣聲音。",
      "notes": "Tool name spelled out, 'free' translated to Chinese, voice names kept as-is"
    },
    {
