  "usage_notes": "Apply this pronunciation map to all display text before feeding to Edge-TTS or other Mandarin/Taiwanese TTS engines. Keep display.txt files unchanged (for subtitles and human reading), and generate separate .tts.txt files with these replacements applied using the prepare-tts.ps1 script."
